1
00:00:00,602 --> 00:00:02,202
(Raj:)so I thought maybe
you could talk to her.

2
00:00:02,204 --> 00:00:04,774
(Sheldon:)Of course.
What seems to be the trouble?

3
00:00:04,773 --> 00:00:05,903
(Bernadette:)Something's wrong.

4
00:00:05,907 --> 00:00:08,207
(Bernadette:)I don't care about
any of the baby stuff

5
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:10,610
(Bernadette:)every other mom is so into.

6
00:00:10,612 --> 00:00:13,982
(Bernadette:)Honestly, I'm not even sure
I like babies.

7
00:00:13,982 --> 00:00:15,982
(Dr Koothrapalli:)Look, some people are
baby people,

8
00:00:15,984 --> 00:00:18,054
(Dr Koothrapalli:)and some people
are not baby people.

9
00:00:18,053 --> 00:00:20,383
(Dr Koothrapalli:)It doesn't mean you won't
love your own baby.

10
00:00:20,389 --> 00:00:23,089
(Bernadette:)But I thought I'd be
more excited.

11
00:00:23,091 --> 00:00:26,891
(Dr Koothrapalli:)Oh, being excited
isn't a guarantee of anything.

12
00:00:26,895 --> 00:00:29,895
(Dr Koothrapalli:)Rajesh's mother was thrilled
when she was pregnant with him.

13
00:00:29,898 --> 00:00:33,338
(Dr Koothrapalli:)After he was born, she doted
on his every move.

14
00:00:33,335 --> 00:00:34,605
(Dr Koothrapalli:)And you know what happened?

15
00:00:34,603 --> 00:00:36,803
(Dr Koothrapalli:)He broke her heart,
moved halfway around the world,

16
00:00:36,805 --> 00:00:38,775
(Dr Koothrapalli:)and dates only
poor white women.

17
00:00:41,643 --> 00:00:43,573
(Dr Koothrapalli:)So you never know.

18
00:00:43,578 --> 00:00:46,518
(Sheldon:)Thank you.
I feel better now.

19
00:00:46,515 --> 00:00:48,615
- I don't!
- Good.

20
00:00:48,617 --> 00:01:00,027
(Dr Koothrapalli:)Bernadette, I hope
you have a daughter.

